27oe|a|Passing through the air on wings, or by the buoyant force of the atmosphere; flying; having the power to fly. ; Capable of wasting away, or of easily passing into the aeriform state; subject to evaporation. ; Fig.: Light-hearted; easily affected by circumstances; airy; lively; hence, changeable; fickle; as, a volatile temper.	e:1awf,44,5~1awf,44,5
